{"unit_id":"yoinchen23-oss__dsh-message-branch#card-zh","repo":"yoinchen23-oss/dsh-message-branch","commit":"37b10eb6e9e4a89a75240d471bd1ed40cc48ea45","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Message Branch 是用于 DeepSeek Harness 网页界面的会话编辑插件，可在用户消息旁打开原位编辑器，并把修改后的纯文本提问发送到新的会话分支。它接入聊天消息渲染位置，保留原会话内容，提交前检查会话状态和历史边界。主要功能包括编辑并取消、从前序事件创建分支、发送修改后的问题，以及在结果不确定时保留分支检查入口。适合需要修正旧提问并重新生成回答的 DSH 用户；不需要额外密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:82-112","lib/client.js:18-80"]}
{"unit_id":"yoinchen23-oss__dsh-message-branch#card-en","repo":"yoinchen23-oss/dsh-message-branch","commit":"37b10eb6e9e4a89a75240d471bd1ed40cc48ea45","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Message Branch adds inline editing for plain-text prompts in DeepSeek Harness. When idle, it forks before the message, resends the revision, and opens the new branch while preserving the original conversation. Users can cancel edits or inspect uncertain results. No extra API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:82-112","lib/client.js:18-80"]}
